Z||000000||GT Bastard||07-16-2000||04:39 PM||||I was at my friends shop the other day and we were just outside talking.  A big whit Cadillac pulls up at the brake & tire shop across the street and my friend says: "did you see that!? A midget just got out of that Caddy and walked inside."  I thought he was full of sh*t and told him so...  A couple minutes later, the midget comes out with a full sized blow-up doll woman!  This time I saw it with my own eyes.  We're guessing this little was having his blow-up doll patched or something, since I don't think they sell blow-up dolls at brake & tire shops.  I'll never feel the same about midgets again....<P>ps-- This should probably be in O/T, but were standing among several Fiero's talking ABOUT Fiero's when this horrific incident occured.||||reg||12
